      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "Dependencies:\n\n* Brain decides how much energy to allocate to each output node,\nBite, Speed, and Sight is linear, Health is dependent on delta Health,\ndelta Health is proportional to -1/(1+exp(energy)),\nand cut off point for negative or positive health is determined bu current health - \nmore hp, more energy needed to keep delta health positive.\n\n",
